@title Protection plot: cable damage and motor start curves with the verdict list
@area Schematic
# A distribution board with motor feeders: the Curves tab shows the device bands, the cable curves and the motor starts, and the verdicts with their words.
open qa/fixtures/distribution-board.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text "Protection: curves"
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot protection-curves
expect "AGAINST CABLE AND MOTOR"
expect "Estimate from typical values"
expect "Cable damage curves"
expect "Motor starts"
check_layout
click_text "Cable damage curves"
wait 6
shot protection-cable-off
click_text "Cable damage curves"
wait 6
click_text "Motor starts"
wait 6
shot protection-motor-off
click_text "Motor starts"
wait 6
shot protection-both-on
check_blank protection-both-on
check_layout
